<title>SWEDEN: SAAB AIRCRAFT SAYS TATRA AIR ORDERS 2 SAAB 2000S.</title>
<headline>SAAB AIRCRAFT SAYS TATRA AIR ORDERS 2 SAAB 2000S.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish aircraft maker Saab Aircraft said on Friday Slovak airline Tatra Air ordered two SAAB 2000s.</p>
</text>
